13. Final validation summary for the two-PDF test
Purpose: capture the main findings from the old-vs-new comparison.

Verified fixes versus old `gt_litellm`
- Old baseline duplicated the same opening chunk across multiple `generator_serial` variants for the same PDF.
- New pipeline produces one ordered chunk stream per PDF using `chunk_index`, `start_page`, and `end_page`.
- New metadata layer resolves one file-level row per PDF with `metadata_status = completed` and `chunk_status = completed`.
- New test index can be recreated, synced, and queried end-to-end using a query embedding.

